#: admin/index.php:601
msgid "Configure The Settings"
msgstr ""

#: .claude/worktrees/dazzling-shamir-f1f2e3/admin/index.php:602
#: admin/index.php:602
msgid ""
"Go to the “Rich Snippets” option in your WordPress dashboard. Under the "
"Configuration tab, select your desired schema type and update the strings "
"you want to display on the front-end. You can use the Customization tab to "
"manage how your rich snippet content box will look."
msgstr ""

#: .claude/worktrees/dazzling-shamir-f1f2e3/admin/index.php:603
#: admin/index.php:603
msgid "Add Markup To Pages"
msgstr ""

#: .claude/worktrees/dazzling-shamir-f1f2e3/admin/index.php:603
#: admin/index.php:603
msgid ""
"Edit the posts or pages where you wish to add rich snippets and scroll down "
"to the “Configure Rich Snippet” meta box to add schema markup."
msgstr ""

#: .claude/worktrees/dazzling-shamir-f1f2e3/admin/index.php:604
#: admin/index.php:604
msgid "Test Your Rich Snippets"
msgstr ""

#: .claude/worktrees/dazzling-shamir-f1f2e3/admin/index.php:604
#: admin/index.php:604
msgid ""
"Google Structured Data Testing is a widely used online tool to test "
"structured data. Open the <a "
"href='https://search.google.com/structured-data/testing-tool/u/0/' "
"target='_blank'>Google Structured Testing Tool</a> and fetch your website "
"URL to test the schema markup you’ve just implemented on your webpages."
msgstr ""

#: .claude/worktrees/dazzling-shamir-f1f2e3/admin/index.php:609
#: admin/index.php:609
msgid "Want to Automate Your Schema Markup?"
msgstr ""

#: .claude/worktrees/dazzling-shamir-f1f2e3/admin/index.php:611
#: admin/index.php:611
msgid "Consider Schema Pro"
msgstr ""

#: .claude/worktrees/dazzling-shamir-f1f2e3/admin/index.php:612
#: admin/index.php:612
msgid ""
"Schema Pro is an advanced schema markup plugin that automates the process "
"of adding schema markup on multiple pages with just a few clicks. Schema "
"Pro uses  JSON-LD markup, which is the latest technology recommended by "
"Google. With it, you can kick those front-end content boxes to the curb "
"and<b> get rich snippets without displaying any new human-readable "
"content</b> on your site."
msgstr ""

#: .claude/worktrees/dazzling-shamir-f1f2e3/admin/index.php:685
#: admin/index.php:685
msgid "With Schema Pro, you can…"
msgstr ""

#: .claude/worktrees/dazzling-shamir-f1f2e3/admin/index.php:695
#: admin/index.php:695
msgid "Testimonials"
msgstr ""

#: .claude/worktrees/dazzling-shamir-f1f2e3/admin/index.php:746
#: admin/index.php:746
msgid "Where can I test my schema markup implementation?"
msgstr ""

#: .claude/worktrees/dazzling-shamir-f1f2e3/admin/index.php:748
#: admin/index.php:748
msgid ""
"You can use the standard Google Structured Data Testing Tool to test your "
"schema markup implementation. You can also take a look at the preview of "
"how your search result might look."
msgstr ""

#: .claude/worktrees/dazzling-shamir-f1f2e3/admin/index.php:753
#: admin/index.php:753
msgid "Do I have to fill in all the details?"
msgstr ""

#: .claude/worktrees/dazzling-shamir-f1f2e3/admin/index.php:755
#: admin/index.php:755
msgid ""
"No. But, every schema type has some fields that HAVE to be filled as stated "
"by Google. Therefore, it is recommended to fill these required fields in "
"the schema markup you are implementing."
msgstr ""

#: .claude/worktrees/dazzling-shamir-f1f2e3/admin/index.php:760
#: admin/index.php:760
msgid "Why does the plugin create extra content in the frontend? Can I hide it?"
msgstr ""

#: .claude/worktrees/dazzling-shamir-f1f2e3/admin/index.php:762
#: admin/index.php:762
msgid ""
"We understand that you don't like the content that gets displayed on your "
"page / post. However, as per the strong recommendation of Google, MicroData "
"should be clearly visible to the user."
msgstr ""

#: .claude/worktrees/dazzling-shamir-f1f2e3/admin/index.php:763
#: admin/index.php:763
msgid "Here is a reference link of what Google says: "
msgstr ""

#: .claude/worktrees/dazzling-shamir-f1f2e3/admin/index.php:764
#: admin/index.php:764
msgid ""
"If you still do not want your schema markup to affect your frontend design, "
"you can use %1$sSchema Pro%2$s - our advanced Schema markup plugin that is "
"built with the latest JSON-LD technology which does not require a content "
"box to be displayed on the front-end."
msgstr ""

#: .claude/worktrees/dazzling-shamir-f1f2e3/admin/index.php:769
#: admin/index.php:769
msgid ""
"Does the plugin work with other plugins like WordPress SEO, WooCommerce, "
"etc?"
msgstr ""

#: .claude/worktrees/dazzling-shamir-f1f2e3/admin/index.php:771
#: admin/index.php:771
msgid ""
"Well, the plugin works perfectly with most of the other plugins as the only "
"thing \"All in One Schema.org Rich Snippets\" does is - it gives you power "
"to add Rich Snippets MicroData to your pages and posts easily."
msgstr ""

#: .claude/worktrees/dazzling-shamir-f1f2e3/admin/index.php:771
#: admin/index.php:771
msgid ""
"If you come across a conflict with any other plugin, please do not hesitate "
"to report an issue."
msgstr ""

#: .claude/worktrees/dazzling-shamir-f1f2e3/admin/index.php:776
#: admin/index.php:776
msgid "How long will it take to show up rich snippets for my search results?"
msgstr ""

#: .claude/worktrees/dazzling-shamir-f1f2e3/admin/index.php:778
#: admin/index.php:778
msgid ""
"We cannot assure the time it will take to display a rich snippet for your "
"search results. This is completely dependent on when your website is "
"crawled by the search engine. However, there are many more factors, such as "
"your website authority that contribute to the time taken for your website "
"to be crawled and a rich snippet displayed."
msgstr ""

#: .claude/worktrees/dazzling-shamir-f1f2e3/admin/index.php:779
#: admin/index.php:779
msgid ""
"If rich snippets are not appearing in your search results as of yet, most "
"probably they might start appearing as soon as Google or other search "
"engines find your website more authoritative."
msgstr ""

#: .claude/worktrees/dazzling-shamir-f1f2e3/admin/index.php:780
#: admin/index.php:780
msgid ""
"Meanwhile - you can validate and see the preview of your rich snippets on "
"%1$s[ Google Structured Data Testing Tool ]%2$s."
msgstr ""

#: .claude/worktrees/dazzling-shamir-f1f2e3/admin/index.php:785
#: admin/index.php:785
